ZVSE2

You can set the following modifiers:

SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Regeneration_Value^/0; Regeneration in percent of HP per turn
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Cast_Spells^/0; Number of casts on target before any attack
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Cast_Spell_ID^/0; Spell ID that should be cast
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Cast_Spell_Damage^/0; Set the damage the spell should cause
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Extra_Shots^/0; Number of extra shots
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Extra_Melee^/0; Number of extra strikes
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Additional_Melee^/0; Number of additional strikes on a random target
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Random_Shots^/0; Number of additional shots on a random target
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Act_Twice^/0; Number of actings per round
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_AOE_Damage_Value^/0;   [set percent as AOE damage]
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Resurrect_Value^/0; set the amount of HP a creature resurrects with in total HP
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Resurrect_Times^/0; set the number of times a creature can resurrect
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Resurrect_Speed_Bonus^/0; Speed gained after every successful resurrection
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Act_Twice_After_Resurrection^/0; Number of resurrections required to enable Act Twice
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Dodge_Value^/0; set the chance to dodge any most physical attacks
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Summon_Creature_ID^/0; set the creature ID that should be summoned
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Summon_Creature_Numbers^/0; set the amount of creatures that will be summoned
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Block_Chance^/0; set the chance by which the stack will block
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Block_Value^/0; set the amount of defelect in percent from 1 to 100
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_BuffSpell_ID_1^/0; set spell 1 ID which should be applied at battle start on all original Boss stacks
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_BuffSpell_Power_1^/; set spell power/effect of that spell, can have different meaning
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_BuffSpell_ID_2^/0; set spell 2 ID which should be applied at battle start on all original Boss stacks
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_BuffSpell_Power_2^/; set spell power/effect of that spell, can have different meaning
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Phase_2_HP_Percent^/0; activate phase 2 once when an original Boss stack reaches this HP percentage
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Phase_2_All_Stats_Percent^/100; percentage applied to current Attack, Defense, min/max Damage and Speed
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Phase_2_Attack_Bonus^/0; additional Attack when phase 2 begins
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Phase_2_Defense_Bonus^/0; additional Defense when phase 2 begins
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Phase_2_Damage_Percent^/100; percentage applied to current min and max damage when phase 2 begins
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Phase_2_Speed_Bonus^/0; additional Speed when phase 2 begins
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Phase_2_Spell_ID^/0; spell applied permanently to the Boss when phase 2 begins
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Melee_Resistance^/0; additional resistance against melee damage in percent
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Ranged_Resistance^/0; additional resistance against ranged damage in percent
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Spell_Damage_Resistance^/0; additional resistance against spell damage in percent
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Round_Aura_Spell_ID^/0; spell effect applied to all living enemy stacks when the round aura activates
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Round_Aura_Spell_Duration^/1; duration of the round aura spell effect
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Round_Aura_Spell_Mastery^/3; mastery of the round aura spell effect
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Round_Aura_Damage^/0; Warrior-base damage dealt to every living enemy stack when the round aura activates
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Round_Aura_Interval^/1; activate the round aura every X battle rounds
SN:W^Arena_%Y1_Round_Aura_Start^/1; first battle round on which the round aura may activate
FU(Arena_Set_Boss_Battle_Def):P%Y1/^Creature.def^; replace the battlefield DEF of Boss stack 21
FU(Arena_Set_Boss_Battle_Def):P%Y1/^Creature.def^/22; optionally target a specific defender stack from 21 to 41



****************************************************************************************************


*Stack-specific Boss appearance
*The DEF name is copied into permanent storage so the engine can safely keep its pointer for the whole battle.
!?FU(OnAfterErmInstructions);
!!FU(NewStrArray)&i^Arena_Boss_Battle_Defs_By_Stack^=(NULL):P651/?i^Arena_Boss_Battle_Defs_By_Stack^/(M_STORED);


!?FU(Arena_Set_Boss_Battle_Def);
!#VA(arenaId:x) (defNamePtr:x) (battleStack:x);
!#VA(numArgs:y) (stackOfSide:y) (storageIndex:y);
*(arenaId) = Arena ID (16-30), (defNamePtr) = pointer to the battle DEF name
*(battleStack) = optional absolute defender stack ID (21-41); defaults to primary Boss stack 21
!!FU|(arenaId)<16/(arenaId)>30:E;
!!FU:A?(numArgs);
!!VR(battleStack)&(numArgs)<3:S21;
!!FU|(battleStack)<21/(battleStack)>41:E;
!!VR(stackOfSide):S(battleStack)-21;
!!VR(storageIndex):S(arenaId)*21 +(stackOfSide);
!!FU(NewStrArray)&i^Arena_Boss_Battle_Defs_By_Stack^=(NULL):P651/?i^Arena_Boss_Battle_Defs_By_Stack^/(M_STORED);
!!SN:Vi^Arena_Boss_Battle_Defs_By_Stack^/(storageIndex)/z(defNamePtr);


*TUM Reborn already hooks this initialization point for its Smooth Criminal disguise.
*Subscribe to its event when TUM is active; otherwise install the Arena callback through ACM.
!?FU(tum_BattleStack_InitDefsAndWavs)&i^Arena_Fight^;
!!FU(Arena_Apply_Boss_Battle_Def):Px1;


!?FU(Arena_BattleStack_InitDefsAndWavs)&i^Arena_Fight^;
!!FU(Arena_Apply_Boss_Battle_Def):Px1;


!?FU(Arena_Apply_Boss_Battle_Def);
!#VA(hook:x) (arenaId:y) (defNamePtr:y) (firstChar:y) (stackStruct:y) (side:y) (stackOfSide:y) (storageIndex:y);
*(hook) = native hook context
!!SN:W^Arena_Challenge_Number^/?(arenaId);
!!FU|(arenaId)<16/(arenaId)>30:E;
!!FU&i^Arena_Boss_Battle_Defs_By_Stack^=(NULL):E;

!!UN:C(hook)/(STRUCT_HOOK_CONTEXT_EBX)/4/?(stackStruct);
!!FU&(stackStruct)=(NULL):E;
!!UN:C(stackStruct)/244/4/?(side) C(stackStruct)/248/4/?(stackOfSide);
!!FU|(side)<>(BATTLE_RIGHT)/(stackOfSide)<0/(stackOfSide)>20:E;

!!VR(storageIndex):S(arenaId)*21 +(stackOfSide);
!!SN:Mi^Arena_Boss_Battle_Defs_By_Stack^/?(defNamePtr)/(storageIndex);
!!FU&(defNamePtr)=(NULL):E;
!!UN:C(defNamePtr)/1/?(firstChar);
!!FU&(firstChar)=0:E;

!!UN:C(hook)/(STRUCT_HOOK_CONTEXT_ECX)/4/(defNamePtr); [battlefield appearance]
!!UN:C(stackStruct)/128/4/(defNamePtr);             [creature information dialog]


****************************************************************************************************




                                  Combat Scripting of Boss Battles




****************************************************************************************************
*code to set new creature name and description for a stack. Values are defined in the arena template
!?FU(OnBattleScreenMouseClick)&i^mouse_battleHex^>0/i^mouse_battleHex^<186/i^Arena_Fight^;
!!SN:W^Arena_Challenge_Number^/?y1; !!FU&y1=0:E; [Exit if it is not Arena Fight]
!!FU|y1<16/y1>30:E;                     [Exit of no boss battle arena ID]
!!CM:D?y1;                              [get click position]
!!BU:Ey1/?y2;                           [check if a monster is at that place]
!!FU&y2=-1:E;                           [get monster ID at position and exit if no monster]
!!FU(Arena_Is_Original_Boss_Stack):Py2/?y90;
!!if&y90=1;                             [if an original Boss stack was clicked]
  !!SN:W^Arena_Challenge_Number^/?y50;
  !!if&y50>=16/y50<=30;                 [Only set description for boss battles]
    !!VRz1:Ss^Arena_%Y50_Boss_Description^;
    !!BMy2:Z?(stackStruct:y);           [Get the stack struct]
    !!FU(WOG_AllocBattleStr):Pz1/?(newDescAddr:y); [get string address]
    !!UN:C(stackStruct)/144/(UNC_INT)/(newDescAddr); [set new description]
  !!en;
!!en;


