!?FU(Arena_Mark_Original_Boss_Stack);
*x1 = battle stack ID, x2 = 1 for an original Boss stack or 0 otherwise
!!SN:W^Arena_Boss_Original_Stack_%X1^/x2;


!?FU(Arena_Is_Original_Boss_Stack);
