    !!VRx4&y91=1:*80:100;               [20% damage reduction for original Arena stacks]
    !!VRx4&x4<0:S0;                     []
  !!en;
!!en;


*Difficulty-scaled damage increase and reduction. Warrior values: +1000 damage and 500 flat damage reduction
!?FU(OnStackToStackDamage)&i^Arena_Fight^;
!!SN:W^Arena_Challenge_Number^/?y1; !!FU&y1=0:E; [Exit if it is not Arena Fight]
!!FU|y1<16/y1>30:E;                     [Exit of no boss battle arena ID]

