  !!en;
!!en;

!!if&x1>=21/x1<=41;                     [if any valid defender battlestack]
  !!FU(Arena_Is_Original_Boss_Stack):Px1/?y91;
  !!if&x2>=0/x2<=20/y91=1;             [if an original Boss stack attacks]
    !!FU(Arena_Apply_Boss_Effect_Difficulty):P1000/?y90;
